Signed-off-by: Sonali Pradhan <sonalipradhan@google.com>
(cherry picked from commit 0e0b0a5aced1a2d92c28362f41a86c8c28a4a2a0)
Signed-off-by: Sonali Pradhan <sonalipradhan@google.com>

Origin: android.googlesource.com/kernel/common a10b2932df624887a416228b8f06fc1ed16a4453
